{"4571290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "玄中记", "steam_appid": 4571290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Eastern fantasy world of Xuanzhong Ji, where cel-shaded art brings ancient mythology to life in a fully immersive 3D open world. Meet loyal friends and kindred spirits, and set out on an unforgettable Xianxia adventure filled with wonder, discovery, and lasting bonds across the vast Xuanzhong continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Massive Hand-Painted World Awaits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling map crafted with stunning cel-shaded art, bringing ancient myths to life. Every corner holds secrets, mysteries, and endless adventures waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/658bba0bc4e05d9621da228ebb77f789.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/658bba0bc4e05d9621da228ebb77f789.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture Hundreds of Spirits &amp; Beasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Xuanzhong is teeming with unique spirits and powerful gods, ready to be found and tamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/d24da76173cedbce1b733863f3fa6df3.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/d24da76173cedbce1b733863f3fa6df3.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Dream Home &amp; Raise a Kun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own sanctuary in the mystical Huanming Mountains. Build, decorate, invite friends over, and nurture your very own adorable Kun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/5b74ffa7458bbdf25528fa0a76e15b63.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/5b74ffa7458bbdf25528fa0a76e15b63.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player-Driven Open Market</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All top-tier gear drops in-game, with tradable items, companion eggs, crafting materials, and more freely available on the open market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/f8ad83939b66657e161faafa676f1f2f.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/f8ad83939b66657e161faafa676f1f2f.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Guild Wars &amp; Territory Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, join a guild, and fight for control over boss territories in chaotic, large-scale PvP battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come to Xuanzhong, and live free as a wild spirit!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Eastern fantasy world of Xuanzhong Ji, where cel-shaded art brings ancient mythology to life in a fully immersive 3D open world. Meet loyal friends and kindred spirits, and set out on an unforgettable Xianxia adventure filled with wonder, discovery, and lasting bonds across the vast Xuanzhong continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Massive Hand-Painted World Awaits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling map crafted with stunning cel-shaded art, bringing ancient myths to life. Every corner holds secrets, mysteries, and endless adventures waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/658bba0bc4e05d9621da228ebb77f789.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/658bba0bc4e05d9621da228ebb77f789.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture Hundreds of Spirits &amp; Beasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Xuanzhong is teeming with unique spirits and powerful gods, ready to be found and tamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/d24da76173cedbce1b733863f3fa6df3.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/d24da76173cedbce1b733863f3fa6df3.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Dream Home &amp; Raise a Kun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own sanctuary in the mystical Huanming Mountains. Build, decorate, invite friends over, and nurture your very own adorable Kun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras/5b74ffa7458bbdf25528fa0a76e15b63.avif?t=1787632303\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571290/extras_big/5b74ffa7458bbdf25528fa0a76e15b63.avif?t=1787632303 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player-Driven Open Market</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All top-tier gear drops in-game, with tradable items, companion eggs, crafting materials, and more freely available on the open market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\